## Required
- nvm, node version manager
- node v18.19.0, install from nvm as a package
- mongosh, any version above version 2.3 is okay 

## how to run
` npm install ` 
to install the dependencies
create a .env file with the mongo uri (refer to .env-template)
`npm run start` to run the project and test connection to mongo atlas 

## how to connect to mongo db
- open cmd 
- run command
     mongosh "mongodb+srv://m1p13-mean-sergiana-haj.v9iqbkb.mongodb.net/" --apiVersion 1 --username <sergiana>